VereineTaxProfilesHonest=Profiles marked with * were suggested by the module. The examples come from the brochure "Vereine und Steuern" of the Austrian ministry of finance. Whether income really belongs to an area depends on the case: in case of doubt, ask the tax advisor. The module calculates and warns; it gives no advice.
