VereineFeesHowToProration=<strong>Prorated when joining:</strong> whoever joins during the fee year pays, depending on the setting, the full amount or only the remaining months, quarters or half-years; the part of joining counts in full. Example 60 € a calendar year, joining on 15 March: by month 10 of 12 months, so 50 €; by quarter 4 of 4 quarters, so 60 €; by half-year the first half, so the full amount. Joining in July by half-year: 30 €.
