VereineDiscountsTitle=Discounts
VereineDiscountsHowToOrder=At most one discount applies to a fee, in this order: an exemption of the member, then a discount with a valid proof, then a discount by age (the first matching line of the list).
VereineDiscountsHowToAge=<strong>By age:</strong> what counts is the age on the first day of the fee period, from the member's birth date. Example "Youth up to 17: 50 %%". A missing birth date is shown in the fee run.
VereineDiscountsHowToProof=<strong>With proof:</strong> for example students or military service. On the member choose the discount and enter until when the proof is valid. An expired proof does not count and is reported in the fee run.
VereineDiscountsHowToExempt=<strong>Exemption:</strong> for example honorary members. On the member tick "Exempt from fees" and enter the reason. The fee run then records the period only, without invoice and without admission fee.
