#
# Families
#
VereineFamilyTitle=Families
VereineFamilyHowToPayer=<strong>Payer:</strong> on the member, choose in "Fees paid by" the third party that gets the invoices, for example a parent. That can be the third party of another member or one that is no member itself. Members with the same payer are a family. Without an entry the member pays itself.
VereineFamilyHowToInvoice=<strong>Invoice:</strong> fees of a family that start on the same day share one invoice to the payer, with one line per member. Every member keeps its own third party or none.
VereineFamilyHowToPercent=<strong>Discount per further member:</strong> the member with the highest fee pays in full, every further member the set percentage less. Example 20 %%: parent 60 €, two children 48 € each.
VereineFamilyHowToCap=<strong>Cap per fee year:</strong> the fees of a family cost at most this amount together in a fee year. What was already charged in the fee year counts. Above it, the new fees are lowered in proportion. Example 120 €: a parent and two children at 60 € each pay 40 € each. A child joining later in the same fee year then pays nothing.
VereineFamilyHowToOrder=The family rule comes after the discount of the single member (exemption, proof, age). It applies only from two members that pay a fee. The admission fee stays the same.
