VereineExitTitle=Exit
VereineExitRuleTitle=Exit according to the statutes
VereineExitHowToRule=<strong>Notice period:</strong> as the statutes say, for example "3 months to the end of the association year". Notice given on 30 September then ends the membership on 31 December; notice on 1 October at the end of the next year. The statutes must say how membership ends (§ 3 (2) no. 5 VerG).
VereineExitHowToMember=<strong>On the member:</strong> tab <em>Association</em>, section <em>Exit</em>. For a resignation the module works out the last day; for exclusion, death or being struck off the day entered counts. An exclusion is decided by the body the statutes name; the module only records day and reason.
VereineExitHowToCron=<strong>On the last day</strong> the scheduled job "Vereine: exits due" sets the member to resiliated or excluded in Dolibarr. Dolibarr's module <em>Scheduled jobs</em> must be enabled for that; otherwise the member offers "Take effect now".
VereineExitHowToFees=<strong>Fees:</strong> the fee run includes a leaving member for every period starting up to the last day, not after.
