#
# SEPA direct debit
#
VereineSepaTitle=SEPA direct debit
VereineSepaHowToModule=<strong>Enable Dolibarr's module <em>Direct debit payment orders</em></strong> and enter the association's creditor identifier there. The fee run then creates the direct debit requests; Dolibarr builds the file for the bank as usual under <em>Bank > Direct debit orders</em>.
VereineSepaHowToMandate=<strong>Mandate:</strong> on the payer's third party, tab <em>Bank accounts</em>, the default account with IBAN, mandate reference and signature date.
VereineSepaHowToExpiry=<strong>Expiry:</strong> a mandate not used for 36 months is no longer valid. The fee run reports it and requests no direct debit for it.
VereineSepaHowToNotice=<strong>Pre-notification:</strong> the invoice states amount, earliest collection day, mandate reference and creditor identifier. 14 calendar days before the collection are usual unless agreed otherwise with the member.
VereineSepaHowToOrder=<strong>In the fee run</strong> "Request direct debit" is ticked. Invoices without a valid mandate stay ordinary invoices.
VereineSepaModuleOff=Dolibarr's module "Direct debit payment orders" is off: the fee run requests no direct debits.
VereineSepaNoCreditorId=The creditor identifier is missing in the module "Direct debit payment orders". It belongs on the pre-notification.
