VereineFunctionHowToBoard=<strong>Board:</strong> functions of the management body. It must consist of at least two persons (§ 5 (3) VerG).
VereineFunctionHowToRepresents=<strong>Represents the association:</strong> who represents it externally according to the statutes. These persons must be reported to the association authority within four weeks (§ 14 (2) VerG).
VereineFunctionHowToAuditors=<strong>Auditors:</strong> every association needs at least two auditors. They may not belong to a body whose activity they audit, so not to the board (§ 5 (4) and (5) VerG).
VereineFunctionHowToTerms=<strong>Terms of office</strong> are entered on the member, tab <em>Association</em>. The overview under <em>Members > Board and functions</em> shows who holds which function and what is missing.
